==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Master A.|Master As]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
If you have him, [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] makes this stage a breeze. If you don't have him, try defeating each [[Master A.]] quickly. If there are too many of them, they will overwhelm you. Once you reach the base, send out longe-range attackers to whittle the base. If you die, it's because of the Master A. s. Prevent them from reaching the base.

